  "description": "1995 Mitsuoka Viewt, the Nissan Micra (K11) based saloon, in its factory colours.\n\nThe Viewt is a retro-styled subcompact from Japanese maker Mitsuoka, styled after the 1963 Jaguar Mark 2. Launched in 1993, it is Mitsuoka's best-selling model, with about 13,000 sold over roughly thirty years. Mitsuoka buys complete Nissan Marches, strips off the interior and exterior panels and rebuilds them by hand in Toyama. This first-generation car is based on the K11 March (1993-2003).\n\nAssetto Corsa model by Chris Rae https://www.instagram.com/pugwonk3/\n3D model by Arq Lugo https://www.youtube.com/@arq_lugo\nThe newest version of this car is always at https://github.com/pugwonk/viewt",
